# Test fixtures are data, not source code. GitHub Linguist maps the .mc
# extension to the M4 macro language, so without these rules the language bar
# reports about 1 MB of M4 against 156 KB of Rust for this repository.
*.mc linguist-vendored
tests/beatmaps/** linguist-vendored

# Keep the release helper LF-only: it is invoked as `bash ci/bump-lib`, and a
# CRLF checkout would make it depend on the shell's tolerance for CR.
/ci/bump-lib text eol=lf
